---
import BuyButton from '../BuyButton.astro';
import CheckCircle from '../CheckCircle.astro';
import { assets } from '../../data/assets';
import { problemList } from '../../data/sidekick';
---
<section class="bg-cream px-5" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1200px] items-center gap-10 py-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,540px)_1fr] lg:gap-14 lg:py-20">
    <img
      src={assets.problemImage}
      alt="A scoop of GLP-1 Sidekick powder pouring into a glass of water beside the jar"
      width="759"
      height="748"
      loading="lazy"
      data-reveal="left"
      class="h-auto w-full rounded-[22px] shadow-[0_18px_40px_rgba(90,60,20,0.18)]"
    />

    <div class="font-nunito" data-stagger>
      <h2 id="problem-title" class="text-[32px] font-extrabold leading-[1.12] text-gold-deep sm:text-[42px]">
        The Hidden Problem With <br class="hidden lg:block" />GLP-1 Weight Loss
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-[1.5] text-[#2b2b33]">
        GLP-1 medications like Semaglutide and Tirzepatide work by reducing appetite. However, this often creates a dangerous physiological trade-off of muscle loss, slowed metabolism and sagging skin.
      </p>
      <hr class="my-4 border-0 border-t border-gold-deep/40" />
      <p class="text-[19px] font-extrabold text-gold-deep">Many patients experience:</p>

      <ul class="mt-3">
        {problemList.map((t) => (
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 py-[7px] transition-transform duration-300 hover:translate-x-1.5">
            <CheckCircle class="h-7 w-7 text-gold-deep" />
            <span class="text-[18px] text-[#2b2b33]">{t}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>

      <p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-[1.5] text-gold-deep">
        <strong class="font-extrabold">You’re losing weight…</strong> but also losing the very things that keep your body and face looking youthful and healthy. GLP-1 SIDEKICK was created to fix that problem.
      </p>
      <BuyButton class="mt-5" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
